    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Species Feats\">Species Feats</a></i></p><p>You have worked hard to eliminate your behavioral tells, making it almost impossible to discern when you are lying.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Twi%27lek\" title=\"Twi'lek\">Twi'lek</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b>&nbsp;Whenever you spend a&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a>&nbsp;to add to a&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> check, increase the die type by two steps (From d6 to d10, or from d8 to d12).</p>",
